# SokoYetu Stage 31C: Public Category Directory and Product Discovery

Stage 31C adds a public product discovery page.

## New page

```text
/categories.html
```

## What it does

- Fetches products from `/api/products`
- Groups products by category
- Lets buyers search products
- Lets buyers filter by category
- Shows product image, price, stock and short description
- Links buyers back to the shop

## Updated files

```text
